{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["This article is about the artifact. For the fruit seed, see ",["l","上古种子","Ancient Seeds"],"."]],["p",["The Ancient Seed is an ",["l","古物","Artifact"]," that can be found by digging up an ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"]," in ",["l","煤矿森林","Cindersap Forest"]," or ",["l","深山","The Mountain"]," (including the ",["l","采石场","Quarry"],"), or obtained inside ",["l","古物宝藏","Artifact Trove"],"s, or ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing Treasure Chests"]," after reaching ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing level 2"],". It can be dropped from ",["l","臭虫","Bug"],"s, ",["l","蛆","Grub"],"s, ",["l","苍蝇","Cave Flies"],", ",["l","突变苍蝇","Mutant Flies"],", and ",["l","突变蛆","Mutant Grub"],"s (0.5% chance). It can also be found by cutting foliage on ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Prehistoric Floors"],", in ",["l","矿井","The Mines"]," when they are in a \"Dangerous\" state, or in the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],". Placing a packet of ",["i","(O)499","Ancient Seeds"]," in a ",["l","分解机","Deconstructor"]," yields an Ancient Seed."]],["p",["This artifact can be ",["l","打造","crafted"]," into viable ",["l","上古种子","seeds"]," that can be planted to grow ",["l","上古水果","Ancient Fruit"]," during ",["l","春季","Spring"],", ",["l","夏季","Summer"]," and ",["l","秋季","Fall"],", or during any season in the ",["l","温室","Greenhouse"]," or the ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"]," farm."]]]],["Donation",2,[["p",["The only productive use of the first Ancient Seed artifact found is to donate it to the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"],". The item contributes to the total count of Museum donations. ",["l","冈瑟","Gunther"]," will reward the player with one pack of plantable Ancient Seeds and the recipe to craft any further Ancient Seed artifacts into more seeds."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Ancient Seed is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe From"]}],[[["f","Ancient_Seeds.png",48]],[["l","上古种子","Ancient Seeds"]],["Could these still grow?"],[["i","(O)114","Ancient Seed ×1"]],["Donating ",["l","古代种子","Ancient Seed"]," to the ",["l","博物馆","Museum"]]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Ancient Seed is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["f","Shirt237.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Brown Suit"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Ancient Seed is not used in any ",["l","任务","quests"],"."]]]]]}